format council-names-v1
# Council / L1 names — the odd-quorum 5x3 register, pronounceable in the elder
# planet-name style, DNS/social-claimable. Synonyms are paired like OUTFITS but for
# L1 chains, with multichain Mycelium .myc support. Several names already name seated
# things (Mala, Murr, Reya, Gren, Linn, Siya) — their reuse is deliberate multi-role,
# one name many roles. PROPOSED for Keaton's word; a real name is claimed by a real
# hand (.sol/.sui), consent-gated. Companion:
# expanding-prompts/20260810-044453_the-3x39-baton-passports-dividers-and-starseeding.md
stamp 20260810.044453
note proposed; pronounceable, predictably spellable; not real-@p-valid (4+ letter segments)

# --- synonym pairs (long / short), outfits for L1 chains ---
pair murr mur
pair mala mal
pair siya siy
pair wovn wov

# --- the wider council set (segmented from Keaton's run-on; approve or adjust) ---
name kyri     (also the notation and coming voice — multi-role)
name kvez     (as in hqkvez — a headquarters outfit)
name kyli
name maic
name mala     (elder: the ~zod / beresheet revival — multi-role)
name murr     (elder: the MMT / central-bank name — multi-role)
name gren     (elder: the Gren season — multi-role)
name jenad
name jingirr
name reya     (elder: a rested voice — multi-role)
name reeh
name linn     (elder: seated — multi-role)
name laye
name atel
name siya     (elder: the Fund — multi-role)
name wovn
